(text "100R across each P/N pair is placed at the FPGA end (HS termination).\nR4 (DNP) taps D0_P for LP-state sensing on FPGA pin 85.\nJ1 = Duo S CON26A (MIPI_TX pair0=D0, pair1=D1, pair2=CLK). J2 pin order is a PLACEHOLDER." (at 140 70 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 4648c59f-96ac-4054-9269-86a12ac055c5))
(text "FPGA pin 79..85 -> J2 pin 1..7 :  79, 80, 81, 82, 83, 84, 85" (at 140 78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 719667f8-5600-4f6a-8581-33ab8e12b325))
